%%{init: {'sequence': {'wrap': true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box Curator ring
    actor CurOp as Curator operator<br/>(upgrade authority)
    participant CurRing as Curator ring program
    end
    box Chain state
    participant CurPC as Curator PolicyConfig
    participant SubPC as Subscriber PolicyConfig
    end
    box Subscriber ring
    participant SubRing as Subscriber ring program
    actor SubOp as Subscriber operator<br/>(upgrade authority)
    end

    rect rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.07)
    Note over CurOp, CurPC: the curator provisions first, a curator without a policy config fails the subscriber with CuratorSourceMissing
    CurOp->>CurRing: create_config, init_spp_ring_config
    CurOp->>+CurRing: create_policy, Block reads its own namespace PDA
    CurRing->>-CurPC: writes the map, policy_hash binds all eight slots
    end

    rect rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.07)
    SubOp->>+SubRing: create_policy, sources = [(Block, curator policy config)]
    SubRing->>CurPC: reads the curator's resolved namespace owner
    Note right of SubRing: copies the RESOLVED address, delegation does not chain, the entries tree must equal the curator's
    SubRing->>-SubPC: writes the map, policy_hash binds it under the compiled table
    end

    Note over CurOp, SubOp: create_policy signs with the upgrade authority, the later set_policy_source with the config authority
